  "description": "Non material amendments under section 96A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) to Conditon 13 of planning permission reference 20/00802/FULL dated 28/01/2021 \r\r20/00802/FULL\r\tDate of Decision: 30/07/2020\r\rCondition Number(s): Condition 13 of planning permission 20/00802/FULL varying the condition on the 2019 permission:\r\rCondition 13 states as follows:\r\rThe roof terraces on level 9 and 10 hereby permitted shall not be used or accessed by\rmembers of the public between the hours of midnight on one day and 8.00 on the following\rday and not at any time on Sundays or Bank Holidays, other than in the case of emergency.\r\r\r\r\rConditions(s) Removal:\r\rTo align the planning permission with the current premises licence for Wagtail (LN/200508782, as varied in March 2025), which now permits operation of the premises (INCLUDING  the terraces) to 02:00 seven days a week in line with the premises opening hours , subject to detailed licence conditions and an agreed Operational Management Plan. Amenity is already safeguarded by existing planning conditions controlling noise from plant and music, together with the Operational Management Plan and licensing controls, so a separate planning hours restriction on the terraces is now in the submission of the applicant, unnecessary and duplicative.\rdeletion of condition 13",
